<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">anti-corrosion-quench</ansi> (alchemy recipe)

An alchemical quench-bath, cloudy and mineral-sharp, that leaves
whatever metal passes through it proof against rot and rust for good.
Steel dipped once emerges duller in shine but somehow more itself, as
though the quench had stripped away every flaw that time might have
found later. Smiths keep it capped tight -- exposed to open air too
long, its potency thins.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       alchemy (minimum 50)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     alchemy_bench
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Salt Pouch (x1), Coal Dust (x1), Beeswax (x1)

